Explain the working of Full wave Center tap rectifier and derive the expression for its efficiency.

A diode crystal having internal resistance of 25 Ω is used for half-wave rectification if the applied voltage is $V = 60\sin\omega t$ and load resistance is 725 Ω, find;

(i) $I_{max}$, $I_{dc}$, $I_{rms}$, (ii) $V_{dc}$ (iii) Efficiency and ripple factor of rectification.
